y military control. It may not describe the same day as the green layer. Control extents can include home territory, dependencies and occupation.</p><p>1783 uses source-year Cliopatria reconstructions, with known unresolved labels withheld. Coverage is not exhaustive. Grey reference land means missing historical coverage, not unclaimed land; its coastline comes from the modern basemap. Economic statistics are game templates, not historical measurements.</p><p>Sources: Natural Earth (public domain); CShapes 2.0, Schvitz et al. (2022), CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; Cliopatria, Seshat Global History Databank, CC BY 4.0. Full provenance and corrections are in atlas/README.md and atlas/data/provenance.json.</p></details>`;
